# Analects Book 11 (先進) — draft, second half: lemmata 38–61 = passages 11.21–11.25.
# Token format as the pilot:
#   tokens separated by " | "; a token is  CHARS[PUNCT][=pinyin][/context gloss[//char gloss//char gloss]]
#   a leading "^" breaks the verse line before the token.
# Punctuation is editorial (the edition has none) and always trails the word before it.
# Pinyin defaults to the glossary's first reading; every polyphone states its reading here, and so does
# every bound compound and every character not yet in the glossary.
# Passages: 11.21 one unit (38); 11.22 one (39); 11.23 six (40–45); 11.24 four (46–49);
# 11.25 twelve (50–61).
# Names: narrative uses courtesy names (Zilu, Ran You, Gongxi Hua, Zeng Xi, Zigao); in speech the
# personal names as shipped: 由 Yóu (accented, as books 2, 5, 6), 求 Qiu, 赤 Chi, 㸃 Dian; 仲由 Zhong You,
# 冉求 Ran Qiu (40). 畏於匡 as shipped at 9.5 ('was in danger at Kuang'). 千乘之國 as 1.5. 佞 'glib' as 5.5.
# 社稷 'the altars of soil and grain'. 大臣 'a great minister'; 具臣 'ministers who fill out the number'
# (Zhu Xi 備臣數而已).
# Speech that opens a unit without 曰 (54, 55, 56 the Master's 求/赤/㸃，爾何如; 60–61, Zeng Xi's
# questions and the Master's answers) carries no Chinese quotation marks, since a unit cannot open with
# punctuation (as 5.8 赤也何如); l and i quote it in English. Quotation marks balance within every unit, as Books
# 5–10 and units_a: where speech runs on past a comment (42–43 after 41, 52 after 51) the continuation is unquoted.
# Readings decided:
#   女 rǔ (39, 音汝); 曾 zēng 'it turns out' (41, Zhu Xi 曾猶乃也, as 3.6); 與 yú question particle
#     (40, 44, 60, 61: Zhu Xi 平聲), yǔ 'and' (41, 43, 45), yǔ 'to side with, approve' (56 吾與㸃);
#   費 bì (46; Zhu Xi 6.7 音秘); 夫 fú 'that, those' (47, 49, 57; Zhu Xi 音扶), fū in 夫子;
#   惡 wù (49, 去聲); 長 zhǎng (51, 上聲); 坐 zuò (50, 才卧反 = modern zuò); 乘 shèng (53, 去聲);
#   饑 jī, 饉 jǐn (53); 比 bì in 比及 (53, 54: Zhu Xi 必二反; the traditional reading, kept; some modern
#     readers say bǐ — note hedges, logged as an open question); 哂 shěn (53, 58, 59); 相 xiàng (55, 去聲); 鏗 kēng; 舍 shě (上聲);
#   撰 zhuàn (士免反); 莫 mù (= 暮) and 冠 guàn (並去聲); 沂 yí; 雩 yú (音于); 率 shuài; 攝 shè;
#   閒 jiān (53); 知 zhī (52, 53); 行 xíng (38); 從 cóng (44, 45); 見 jiàn (60); 樂 yuè (54);
#   為 wéi throughout (to take as / act as / manage / count as / govern).
# Bound compounds used that are not yet GLOSS keys: 父兄, 季子然, 大臣, 具臣, 子羔, 社稷, 曾晳, 率爾,
#   師旅, 饑饉, 宗廟, 㑹同, 章甫, 鏗爾, 舞雩, 諸侯. Existing: 子路, 冉有, 公西華, 如之何, 顔淵,
#   仲由, 冉求, 千乘, 夫子, 何如, 童子, 喟然, 君子.
#   Not bound: 兼 | 人, 民 | 人, 讀 | 書, 然 | 則, 然 | 後, 何 | 必, 是 | 故, 大 | 國, 比 | 及, 小 | 相,
#   春 | 服, 冠 | 者, 三 | 子 | 者, 禮 | 樂, 為 | 國.
# Collation: Ruan 1816 agrees with Zhu Xi throughout this half. He Yan (SBCK), noted in the unit:
#   38 如之何其聞斯行之也; 53 大國間 (no 之); 54 足民也; 55 能之也; 56 暮春, 得冠者; 59 子曰為國以禮;
#   61 宗廟之事如會同, 非諸侯如之何, 孰能為之大相. Not noted (graphic): 汝, 曽, 晢, 乗, 飢, 點, 舎, 悪, 礼, 無/毋.

